kipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Ford_(Nevada_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Aaron_Ford_(Nevada_politician)"}},"extract":"Aaron Darnell Ford is an American lawyer and politician currently serving as the 34th attorney general of Nevada since 2019. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously served as a member of the Nevada Senate representing the 11th district from 2013 to 2018. He served as Nevada Senate majority and minority leader.","extract_html":"<p><b>Aaron Darnell Ford</b> is an American lawyer and politician currently serving as the 34th attorney general of Nevada since 2019. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously served as a member of the Nevada Senate representing the 11th district from 2013 to 2018. He served as Nevada Senate majority and minority leader.</p>"}